{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pawn.OS()</strong> is a programming puzzle game where you use a custom scripting language to control a <strong>pawn</strong> across a series of <strong>grid-based</strong> challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This custom language blends elements of popular programming languages like Python, Lua etc...designed specifically for this game to be easy to learn. Even if you\u2019ve never coded before, Pawn.OS() guides you step by step through interactive, logic-driven puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve <strong>30</strong> handcrafted logic puzzles using a custom scripting language</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No coding experience needed\u2014learn through guided play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual <strong>line-by-line execution highlighting</strong> helps you understand your script</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Error highlighting</strong> system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimize you</strong>r code and compare with others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on a global <strong>leaderboard</strong> based on code efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, grid-based interface with readable, structured feedback</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Line highlighting during execution:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835040/extras/ab0cd52233b4bfdfc448045b71944b09.poster.avif?t=1754666827\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835040/extras/ab0cd52233b4bfdfc448045b71944b09.webm?t=1754666827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s